{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:11 2026-09-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:11 2026-09-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:11 2026-09-02 HKT</p><p>港鐵堅尼地城站發生扶手電梯意外。今日（9月2日）中午12時30分，一男一女在站內月台乘搭扶手電梯前往大堂，其間懷疑失平衡，在扶手電梯上跌倒受傷。救護員到場替兩人包紮傷口後，送往瑪麗醫院治理。</p><p>現場消息稱，男傷者年約七旬，右手受傷清醒；而女傷者的傷勢亦不算嚴重。事故發生後，涉事扶手電梯需要暫時圍封停用，意外原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"工程人員圍封涉事扶手電梯。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/02b6c361b32dd6ba2935c33b806a8dc7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_44_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事扶手電梯需圍封檢查維修。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b591aa967480d030ab77923830d387b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_46.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/775283e4d411c3688b64306f21146cde/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_46_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c28d8a645e653ffc90d259391380964/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_44.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c773cd410ee2b60fb508fcab106b34c0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_43.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b04e5ed563fd414569e5c6930852e6d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_42_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事發於堅尼地城站內。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10248d8b43e074a2a53b234fff1ac740/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_48.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者由救護車送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89409b2b17fda9631d5cb36f4dd01759/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_47.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1578c1f7d38c24a258b51ac8cf72a8d8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_13_50_42.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T06:24:00.799821+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}